#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Clock & Timing Engine
#  File: clock_timing_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS timing engine responsible for:
#      • system clock access
#      • high‑precision timers
#      • repeating intervals
#      • scheduler tick generation
#      • timing telemetry
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [System Clock](ca://s?q=Explain_System_Clock)
#    - [One‑Shot Timers](ca://s?q=Explain_One_Shot_Timers)
#    - [Interval Timers](ca://s?q=Explain_Interval_Timers)
#    - [Scheduler Tick](ca://s?q=Explain_Scheduler_Tick)
#    - [Timing Telemetry](ca://s?q=Explain_Timing_Telemetry)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - now()
#         Returns system time.
#
#    - monotonic()
#         Returns monotonic clock.
#
#    - timer(delay, handler)
#         Creates one‑shot timer.
#
#    - interval(every, handler)
#         Creates repeating interval.
#
#    - cancel(timer_id)
#         Cancels timer or interval.
#
#    - run()
#         Executes timing loop.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns timing engine state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  TIMER STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "TMR-XXXX",
#      "delay": 1.5,
#      "fires_at": <epoch>,
#      "handler": <async callable>
#    }
#
